[00:00.00] 作词 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Nevin Sastry
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Collins Obinna Chibueze/Nevin Sastry
[00:14.30] Road, down these salty roads
[00:14.30] 沿着这些咸涩的路途
[00:19.29] How far does it go?
[00:19.29] 它究竟通向何方？
[00:22.31] Should've brought my four-by-four
[00:22.31] 真该开上我的越野车
[00:27.76] Smoke, I stepped out for a smoke
[00:27.76] 烟雾缭绕 我出门抽支烟
[00:32.45] We been at it all night long
[00:32.45] 我们整夜争执不休
[00:36.26] At each other's throats
[00:36.26] 彼此针锋相对
[00:41.16] Lived a lot of life and my biggest mistake
[00:41.16] 历经沧桑 此生最大错误
[00:44.21] Is leaving my town with a pretty lady
[00:44.21] 是带着漂亮姑娘远离家乡
[00:47.85] Shredded my heart like a day old paper
[00:47.85] 她将我心撕碎如旧报纸
[00:51.30] Ran me wild and drove me crazy
[00:51.30] 让我疯狂 令我痴狂
[00:54.71] Old vibrations, familiar faces
[00:54.71] 熟悉频率 似曾相识脸庞
[00:58.11] Hollywood of all the goddamn places
[00:58.11] 偏偏是好莱坞这鬼地方
[01:01.46] Been so long, I need a long vacation
[01:01.46] 阔别已久 急需长假疗伤
[01:04.86] Lived my life like it was one big Vegas
[01:04.86] 我的人生就像一场盛大赌局
[01:11.64] Lived my life like it was one big Vegas
[01:11.64] 我的人生就像一场盛大赌局
[01:22.15] I pour my shame inside my cup and drink myself to sleep
[01:22.15] 将羞愧倒入酒杯 饮至昏沉睡去
[01:25.78] If I make it through the night, then it's a sweet dream
[01:25.78] 若能熬过今夜 便是美梦一场
[01:29.06] I got demons, devils calling me
[01:29.06] 恶魔低语 邪灵将我召唤
[01:32.46] Came out the gutter covered in dirt, got it all over me
[01:32.46] 从泥泞爬出 浑身沾满污垢
[01:35.40] I'm sipping on whiskey, I'm feeling it now
[01:35.40] 威士忌入喉 此刻醉意正浓
[01:36.97] Tell Mama I'm sorry for letting her down
[01:36.97] 告诉妈妈 愧对她期望落空
[01:38.72] Was looking for commas, nowhere to be found
[01:38.72] 寻找财富却始终不见踪影
[01:40.45] Know deep in my gut that they coming around
[01:40.45] 心底深知好运终将降临
[01:42.15] Remember my Chevy was stuck in the pound
[01:42.15] 记得雪佛兰被扣押在车场
[01:43.82] I didn't have money to go get it out
[01:43.82] 身无分文无力赎回车辆
[01:45.88] Remember I needed favors
[01:45.88] 记得那时需要施舍援手
[01:47.68] Now I don't need a savior
[01:47.68] 如今不再需要救世主
[01:48.81] Lived a lot of life and my biggest mistake
[01:48.81] 历经沧桑 此生最大错误
